     [38;5;246mConsole transport by default, remote HTTP transport enabled by config. Zero dependencies, no build step, redaction
[39m     [38;5;246mstays on your side.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Third-party service
     [38;5;246mSentry/Datadog/LogRocket. Grouping, symbolication, and alerting for free, at the cost of a dependency, a build [39m
     [38;5;246mstep, and vendor data sharing.[39m
